<header><p class="st-kicker">duchy · Italy</p><h1 class="st-title">Duchy of Romagna</h1><p class="st-meta">1501 CE – 1503 CE · capital Cesena</p></header>
<p class="st-teaser">Cesare Borgia's brief state in Romagna, carved out with papal backing and studied by Machiavelli as a model of ruthless princely power.</p>
<div class="st-body"><div class="st-text"><h2>Origins</h2><p>Between 1499 and 1501 <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cesare-borgia">Cesare Borgia</a>, son of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pope-alexander-vi">Pope Alexander VI</a>, conquered the small lordships of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/romagna">Romagna</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/marche">Marche</a>, including <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/imola">Imola</a>, Forlì, <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/lordship-of-pesaro">Pesaro</a>, <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/lordship-of-rimini">Rimini</a> and <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/lordship-of-faenza">Faenza</a>, with French and papal troops. In 1501 his father named him Duke of Romagna, with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cesena">Cesena</a> as the seat of government.</p><h2>Rule and society</h2><p><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cesare-borgia">Cesare</a> imposed order on a region torn by petty lords, setting up a central court of justice, the Rota, at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cesena">Cesena</a>. He sent his harsh governor <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ramiro-de-lorqua">Ramiro de Lorca</a> to pacify the region, then had him executed in the square of Cesena in December 1502 to win popularity. At <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sena-gallica">Senigallia</a> that month he trapped and killed rebellious captains. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/niccolo-machiavelli">Niccolò Machiavelli</a>, a Florentine envoy, observed him closely and later praised his methods in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/the-prince">The Prince</a>.</p><h2>Decline and legacy</h2><p><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pope-alexander-vi">Alexander VI</a> died in August 1503 while <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cesare-borgia">Cesare</a> was gravely ill. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pope-julius-ii">Pope Julius II</a>, a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/house-of-borgia">Borgia</a> enemy, reclaimed the towns for the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/papal-states">Papal States</a>, while <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/venice">Venice</a> seized <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/lordship-of-rimini">Rimini</a> and <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/lordship-of-faenza">Faenza</a>.</p></div><aside class="st-side"><div class="st-emblem" role="img" aria-label="duchy, 1501 CE – 1503 CE"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 74 H80 V60 H20 Z"/><path d="M20 60 Q35 46 50 60 Q65 46 80 60"/><circle cx="20" cy="54" r="3"/><circle cx="35" cy="48" r="3"/><circle cx="50" cy="44" r="3"/><circle cx="65" cy="48" r="3"/><circle cx="80" cy="54" r="3"/></svg><p class="st-emblem-type">duchy</p><p class="st-emblem-region">Italy</p><div class="st-span" aria-hidden="true"><span class="st-span-bar" style="left:89.57%;width:1.20%"></span></div><div class="st-span-axis" aria-hidden="true"><span>3000 BCE</span><span>1 CE</span><span>2000</span></div></div><dl class="st-facts"><dt>Years</dt><dd>1501 CE – 1503 CE</dd><dt>Century</dt><dd><a href="/centuries/16th-century">16th century</a></dd><dt>Type</dt><dd>duchy</dd><dt>Character</dt><dd>feudal</dd><dt>Capital</dt><dd>Cesena</dd><dt>Rulers</dt><dd>Cesare Borgia</dd><dt>Religion</dt><dd>Catholic Christianity</dd><dt>Language</dt><dd>Romagnol, Italian</dd><dt>Today</dt><dd><a href="/countries/italy">Italy</a></dd><dt>Also</dt><dd>Borgia Romagna</dd></dl><figure class="st-locator"><a href="/atlas?year=1502&amp;focus=duchy-of-romagna" aria-label="Duchy of Romagna on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="4973 615 640 512" role="img" aria-label="Map: where Duchy of Romagna lay"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-tie" d="M5293 871L5304 942"/><path class="map-dot-n" d="M5304 942h0"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M5293 871h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M5293 871h0"/></s